# The coast's cliff meadow in a held wind (src/render/wind.gdshaderinc,
# src/render/foliage/grass.gdshader, src/systems/18_trample.gd). Played through
# the real game on the seed the canon uses:
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/foliage_meadow.tour --seed=7
#
# What it is for, in both views: two frames half a second apart, in which a gust
# front has visibly moved across the sward (the paler, laid-over grass); and a
# frame of the player standing in the grass it has parted round them, with the
# path walked lying pressed behind. Then what the grass costs, shown and hidden
# inside the run, from above and over the shoulder.
weather clear:0:wind=0.9
hour 10
coast calm
place coast
near meadow
wait 2.5
shot 01-gust-from-above with land:coast
wait 0.5
shot 02-gust-half-a-second-on with land:coast
walk 1,0 0.6
wait 0.2
shot 03-parted-round-the-player with land:coast
zoom 6
wait 0.4
shot 04-parted-close with land:coast
zoom 12
perf noise 6.0
perf decor 6.0
perf grass 6.0
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
wait 0.8
shot 05-gust-over-the-shoulder with land:coast
wait 0.5
shot 06-gust-over-the-shoulder-half-a-second-on with land:coast
walk 0,-1 0.6
wait 0.2
shot 07-parted-over-the-shoulder with land:coast
perf noise 6.0
perf decor 6.0
perf grass 6.0
release shoulder_peek
weather rules
